###Criar conta
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "teste",
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "idioma": "pt-BR",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Entrar (senha certa)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Entrar (senha errada)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "errada"
}